  var ROUTES = "In our simplified route model, a pump is needed to move water from a lower height to a higher height. Gravity can move water along an open downward channel. The route from 2 metres to 6 metres and the route from 1 metre to 4 metres need a pump. The route from 6 metres to 2 metres and the route from 5 metres to 3 metres can use gravity.";
